{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53072","headline":"朱泚乱定後上皇帝（题拟） · 论惟明","name":"朱泚乱定後上皇帝（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"豺狼暴宫阙，拔涂凌丹墀。\n花木久不芳，羣凶亦自疑。\n既爲皇帝枯，亦爲皇帝滋。\n艹木尚多感，报恩须及时。\n（见唐赵元一《奉天录》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"论惟明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53072.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53072","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}